Template: lines-logos/port
Type: string
Default: 3001
Description: Port the app listens on (internal if you use a reverse proxy).

Template: lines-logos/domain
Type: string
Description: Public domain name (blank to access by IP only).
 Leave blank if you will point your own reverse proxy at the app.

Template: lines-logos/stripe-pk
Type: string
Description: Stripe publishable key (blank to skip — set later in the app).
 Get it: dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys (pk_live_… or pk_test_…).

Template: lines-logos/stripe-sk
Type: password
Description: Stripe secret key (blank to skip — set later in the app).
 Get it: dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys → Secret key → Reveal. Guard it like a password.

Template: lines-logos/stripe-wh
Type: password
Description: Stripe webhook signing secret, whsec_… (blank to skip — set later in the app).
 Get it: dashboard.stripe.com/webhooks → Add endpoint → your-domain/api/stripe/webhook →
 invoice.paid, invoice.payment_failed, invoice.voided, invoice.marked_uncollectible,
 credit_note.created, checkout.session.completed → Signing secret.

Template: lines-logos/openrouter
Type: password
Description: OpenRouter API key — FREE AI default (blank to skip — set later in the app).
 Get it: openrouter.ai/keys → Create Key. Powers the website chat assistant + AI agents.

Template: lines-logos/anthropic
Type: password
Description: Anthropic (Claude) API key — optional, paid (blank to skip).
 Get it: console.anthropic.com/settings/keys

Template: lines-logos/openai
Type: password
Description: OpenAI (ChatGPT) API key — optional, paid (blank to skip).
 Get it: platform.openai.com/api-keys

Template: lines-logos/gemini
Type: password
Description: Google Gemini API key — optional, free tier (blank to skip).
 Get it: aistudio.google.com/apikey
